const services=[
['Single-family residences','A clear opinion of value for purchase, refinance and private valuation needs.','Understand the value of your single-family residence with local market research and a well-supported report. Share the intended use, property location and timing so the appropriate scope can be established.'],
['Condominiums & townhomes','Local insight for attached housing and planned residential developments.','Appraisals for condominiums and townhomes consider property features, comparable sales and the context of the development. Discuss the requirements of your purchase, refinance or private valuation.'],
['2–4 unit residential','Thoughtful analysis for duplexes, triplexes and fourplexes.','Small residential income properties require attention to both the property and its market context. Request a quote for your duplex, triplex or fourplex and clarify the scope of your assignment.'],
['Luxury & complex homes','A closer look at custom homes, rural acreage and unique properties.','Distinctive properties call for careful research. Share details about your custom home, rural acreage or unusual property features to discuss the analysis and timing your assignment may require.'],
['Vacant residential land','A grounded perspective on residential lots and land.','Residential lot and land valuations consider the characteristics of the parcel and relevant market evidence. Supply the parcel location, intended use and available information to discuss the appropriate assignment.'],
['FHA & conventional','Residential appraisal assignments for lending requirements.','Appraisal services for FHA and conventional residential lending assignments. Lenders typically arrange lending appraisals through their required ordering process; contact your lender to confirm how your appraisal should be ordered.'],
['Estate, divorce & private use','Clear valuations for planning, settlement and important decisions.','Property valuations can support estate planning, settlement, divorce and private decision-making. Share the intended use, relevant valuation date and requirements from your advisers so the scope can be discussed.'],
['Desktop, exterior & updates','Scope-specific products when appropriate for your assignment.','Desktop appraisals, exterior-only assignments and updates are available when the property, purpose and applicable requirements make that scope appropriate. Ask which approach may fit your needs.']];
